.problem
Program does not overwrite for bits 10 and 11 in
status register when ruwmn6 on a VT78. After
maindec title is printed program does not come
back with SR=0000 so you can have the option of using
pseudo SR.
.solution
Program now overwrites for bits 10 and 11 in status
register if running on a VT78. After maindec title
is printed, comes back with SR=0000 so you can have
the option of using pseudo SR.
